---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AgentLine Compare | 连上去 vs 管起来"
  description="解释 AgentLine 的品类边界：从单会话远程连接升级为多会话监督与吞吐管理。"
>
  <Header activePage="compare" />
  <main id="main-content" class="topic-main page-compare">
    <section class="topic-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Compare</p>
        <h1>当你需要的不只是“连上去”，而是“管起来”</h1>
        <p class="lead">如果你已经能远程连终端，但仍在多会话调度和移动审批上低效，AgentLine 是下一层。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="anchor-wrap">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="anchor-strip" aria-label="Compare anchors">
          <a href="#category">品类边界</a>
          <a href="#matrix">能力矩阵</a>
          <a href="#fit">适用人群</a>
          <a href="#next">下一步</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container snap-deck">
      <section id="category" class="story-panel">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/session-running-real.png" alt="Conversation panel for supervising an active agent session" width="1440" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">01 / Category</p>
          <h2>品类边界</h2>
          <p>单会话远程控制解决“连接问题”；AgentLine 解决“监督与吞吐问题”。</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="matrix" class="story-panel is-reverse">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/sessions-list-real.png" alt="Unified dashboard for comparing session supervision capabilities" width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">02 / Matrix</p>
          <h2>能力矩阵</h2>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="comparison-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>维度</th>
                  <th>单会话远程控制</th>
                  <th>AgentLine</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>新建会话能力</td><td>有限</td><td>完整支持</td></tr>
                <tr><td>多会话总览</td><td>弱</td><td>强</td></tr>
                <tr><td>移动审批体验</td><td>基础</td><td>监督导向</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Diff 审阅</td><td>有限</td><td>完整</td></tr>
                <tr><td>跨入口会话互通</td><td>有限</td><td>完整</td></tr>
                <tr><td>连接拓扑灵活性</td><td>中</td><td>高</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="fit" class="story-panel">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/overview-projects-real.png" alt="Multi-project overview for power users and teams" width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">03 / Fit</p>
          <h2>适用人群</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>并行跑多个代理任务的独立开发者</li>
            <li>需要随时处理阻塞的小团队</li>
            <li>希望把代理“排队等待”改成“持续推进”的工程组织</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="next" class="story-panel is-reverse is-mobile-shot">
        <figure class="story-media">
          <img src="/screenshots/session-mobile-real.png" alt="Actionable mobile workflow for the next step" width="430" height="932" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <p class="kicker">04 / Next Step</p>
          <h2>如果你认同这个工作流，下一步就是跑起来</h2>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="/install" class="btn btn-primary">安装 AgentLine</a>
            <a href="/security-relay" class="btn btn-secondary">查看部署方式</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
